# AMD GPU firmware - xxri-firmware-amd.tcz (rules/xxri-firmware-amd.make)
#
# Source: linux-firmware 20260810 (pinned in rules/pre/xxri.make), through its
# WHENCE by scripts/xxri-fw-select.py.  Per GPU, every file Tiny Core
# 6.12.11's driver declares for it (scripts/xxri-fw-requested.sh): amdgpu
# gives up on a GPU when the firmware of one of its IP blocks is missing,
# so there is no per-block trimming.
#
# Scope: AMD GPUs up to the 2015-era GCN generations.  Older Radeons (R100 ..
# Northern Islands, Palm/Sumo/Aruba APUs) are in xxri-firmware-gpu.tcz
# (gpu.list).
#
# 1. amdgpu, Volcanic Islands (GCN 3): Tonga (R9 285, R9 380/380X), Fiji
#    (R9 Fury/Fury X/Nano), Topaz/Iceland (R7 M260/M265 laptops), Carrizo
#    (2015 A8/A10/FX-8800P APUs) and Stoney Ridge (A6-9220, A9-9420, E2-9000
#    APUs: 2016, but the same GCN 3 generation, and common in low-cost
#    laptops that still boot BIOS/CSM)
amdgpu/carrizo_ce.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_me.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_mec2.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_mec.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_pfp.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_rlc.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_sdma1.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_sdma.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_uvd.bin
amdgpu/carrizo_vce.bin
