# 2. radeon (6.12.11 builds amdgpu without SI/CIK support), new-format files:
#    Southern Islands, GCN 1 (tahiti pitcairn verde oland hainan; banks =
#    Hainan variant): HD 7700-7900, R7 240-250, R9 270-280X, HD 8000M/R5 M
#    Sea Islands, GCN 2 (bonaire hawaii kaveri kabini mullins): R7 260/360,
#    R9 290/390, Kaveri/Kabini/Beema/Mullins APUs
#    (UVD/VCE video firmware left out, as in gpu.list: radeon runs without)
