#
# Left out: Polaris (RX 400/500, 2016) and everything newer - Vega, Navi
# /RDNA 1-4 (RX 5000 .. RX 9000), Raven/Renoir and newer APUs, and the
# Instinct accelerators.  amdgpu still binds them and, without firmware,
# fails after it has taken the screen over (docs/gpu-cpu-support.md).
